<title>USA: EMERGENCY WEATHER CONDITIONS -  WSC - 10-DEC					     .</title>
<headline>EMERGENCY WEATHER CONDITIONS -  WSC - 10-DEC					     .</headline>
<text>
<p>Tropical Cyclone Daniella has mostly dissipated in the south Indian Ocean near 25s/59e. It is no longer considered a threat to shipping.</p>
<p>Tropical Cyclone 09S is becoming an increasing threat to shipping in the South Indian Ocean. This storm, centered near 13s/84e, is moving west at 17 mph and will continue this track while intensifying this period.  </p>
<p>THERE ARE NO FURTHER EMERGENCY STATEMENTS AT THIS TIME  </p>
